\b APE PFAC PSSM 5 Leadership Toolkit Bibliography\b0\par
\par
\b Purpose\b0\par
This bibliography supports the MPH Applied Practice Experience toolkit. Rosie Bartel is treated as the patient story anchor and acknowledgement source. Formal peer-reviewed and standards sources remain the evidence layer. Public toolkits and open resources are used for benchmarking, design learning, and practical implementation comparison.\par
